# Archived AGENTS.md Notes

This file intentionally no longer stores a full legacy prompt. Older versions
included Claude-era and non-portable orchestration terms such as `TeamCreate`,
`TaskCreate`, fixed `/agent` usage, and mandatory coordinator-only behavior.

The repository-root `AGENTS.md` is the source of truth for the current
Codex-native prompt; `AGENTS.md.template` is a generated mirror of it.
